    <h1 class="display-lg reveal reveal-delay-1" style="color:#fff;max-width:820px;">Hella: an automotive brand for workshop, trade and end customer</h1>
    <p class="body-lg reveal reveal-delay-2" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,.88);max-width:720px;margin-top:1rem;">One brand, three levels, one end customer at the end.</p>
